1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,300
有人说，重庆没有平地。
They say Chongqing has no flat ground.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,600
整座城，盖在山和江之间。
A whole city wedged between mountains and rivers.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,000
导航到了这里，也会迷路。
Even GPS loses its way here.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,800
一栋楼的一楼，可能是别人的十楼。
A ground floor here can be someone's tenth.

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:23,100
轻轨，直接从居民楼里穿出来。
A train bursts straight through an apartment block.

6
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:27,400
李子坝站，2004 年就这样建了。
Liziba station was built like this back in 2004.

7
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,700
全国第一条跨座式单轨。
China's very first straddle monorail.

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:36,000
列车穿楼，只要八秒。
Eight seconds to pass through the building.

9
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:41,800
想过江？坐索道。
Want to cross the river? Take a cable car.

10
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:46,100
「万里长江第一条空中走廊」。
The Yangtze's first sky corridor.

11
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:50,400
当地人叫它「空中公交车」。
Locals just call it the sky bus.

12
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,700
爬坡上坎，是重庆人的日常。
Climbing slopes is everyday life here.

13
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:00,500
巷子深处，一锅红汤在滚。
Deep in an alley, a pot of red broth boils.

14
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,800
麻辣升腾，像这座城的脾气。
Spice rising up — like the city's temper.

15
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:09,100
老板一句「要得」，就是成交。
"Yào-dé," says the owner — deal done.

16
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,900
天黑了，洪崖洞亮起来。
As dusk falls, Hongyadong lights up.

17
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:19,200
像《千与千寻》里的那座城。
Like the town in Spirited Away.

18
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:23,500
灯火顺着山崖，一层层堆上去。
Lights stack up the cliff, tier by tier.

19
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,300
山不厌高，水不厌深。
Mountains never tire of height, nor rivers of depth.

20
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:33,600
重庆把「难走」，走成了风景。
Chongqing turned "hard to walk" into a view.

21
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:37,900
这不是一座城，是一座立体迷宫。
Not a city — a maze built in three dimensions.

22
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:42,500
下次来，你敢自己找路吗？
Next time — dare to find your own way?
